 "note": "The 36 cells that RUN on this landing and go `check-clean invalid wasm` the moment `emitUnionCoerce`'s equal-heap box arm (D281's rung, #1980) is removed \u2014 30 of them already on MASTER, 6 more only under D282's anonymous-claimant merge, which makes that arm reachable at six new coordinates. Named because D281's rung scored ZERO on every population that existed when it shipped (5,188 per-row grid cells, the distilled corpus, census block B): a rung no derived rule can price is exactly the rung a named set has to carry. Regenerate the grid with scripts/silent-sweep/d282/gen282.py, materialise with scripts/silent-sweep/d243/mkset.py, grade with census/gradecensus.py \u2014 the histogram must be `runs 36` and nothing else. The same 36 are kept WHOLE in the standing gate at scripts/silent-sweep/distilled/named/d282_*.vl."
